    "text": "Cum et sine ablātīvum regunt. In hīs nōminibus tertiae dēclīnātiōnis ablātīvus singulāris in -e dēsinit: mātre, patre, frātre, sorōre, pāstōre, cane. Cum mātre comitem indicat; sine mātre comitem abesse indicat. Ad mātrem fīnem mōtūs indicat."
